     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Q1 2021: No progress yet

Q2 2021: 
1. Some progresses have been accomplished including: (a) 45 districts across 9 governorates were selected to implement capacity development plan; (b) 23 districts in the areas under International Recognized Government (IRG) control have been assessed for local governance diagnostic (Rapid Need Assessment).
2. Four governorates: Aden, Hadramaut, Lajh, Taizz (southern part) have formed the District Facilitation Teams.  
3. No progress yet. 
4. Some activities have completed to reach out this result including the identification of responsible parties to support the District Facilitation Teams in developing and/or implementing the district development plans.
